{"translation":{"id":"aii_abt","name":"ܕܝܬܩܐ ܚܕܬܐ ܕܡܪܢ ܝܫܘܥ ܡܫܝܚܐ ܘܡܙܡܘܪ̈ܐ ܒܠܫܢܐ ܐܬܘܪܝܐ","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=aii","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=aii","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"ABT","englishName":"Assyrian Neo-Aramaic NT+Psalms","language":"aii","textDirection":"rtl","sha256":"1859152dbbffe55d2b7ac6d4c09fbad5a6416ca25359e69220bb358dac602444","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/aii_abt/books.json","numberOfBooks":28,"totalNumberOfChapters":410,"totalNumberOfVerses":10420,"languageName":"Assyrian Neo-Aramaic","languageEnglishName":"Assyrian Neo-Aramaic"},"book":{"id":"PSA","translationId":"aii_abt","name":"ܡܙܡܘܪ̈ܐ","commonName":"ܡܙܡܘܪ̈ܐ","title":"ܡܙܡܘܪ̈ܐ","order":19,"numberOfChapters":150,"sha256":"08b7c4463dda6adc56b2c377f42d67ace350af655720940a2e395776a718fc6c","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/aii_abt/PSA/1.json","lastChapterNumber":150,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/aii_abt/PSA/150.json","totalNumberOfVerses":2461},"chapter":{"number":76,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["ܠܪܝܫ ܓܘܕܐ ܕܙܡܪ̈ܐ. ܒܩܝܬܪ̈ܐ ܡܙܡܘܪܐ ܕܐܣܦ. ܙܡܪܬ‌ܐ."]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":[{"text":"ܦܝܼܫܵܐ ܝܠܹܗ ܝܕܝܼܥܵܐ ܐܲܠܵܗܵܐ ܓܵܘ ܝܼܗܘܼܕܵܐ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܓܘܼܪܵܐ ܝܠܹܗ ܫܸܡܹܗ ܓܵܘ ܐܝܼܣܪܵܐܹܝܠܔ.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܘܗܘܹܐ ܠܵܗ̇ ܡܛܲܠܠܹܗ ܓܵܘ ܫܵܠܝܼܡ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܘܡܲܥܡܪܹܗ ܓܵܘ ܨܸܗܝܘܿܢ.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܬܵܡܵܐ ܬܒ݂ܝܼܪܹܗ ܠܓܹܐܪܹ̈ܐ ܠܵܗܝܵܢܹ̈ܐ ܕܩܸܫܬܵ‌ܐ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܡܵܛܵܠܵܐ ܘܣܲܝܦܵܐ ܘܙܲܝܢܵܐ ܕܦܠܵܫܵܐ. ܣܹܠܵܗ","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܫܲܦ̮ܩܵܢܵܐ ܝܘܸܬ ܐܲܢ݇ܬ، ܒܘܼܫ ܡܫܘܼܒܚܵܐ ܡ̣ܢ ܛܘܼܪ̈ܵܢܹܐ ܐܲܝܟܵܐ ܕܦܘܼܪܦܸܛ ܠܘܼܟ݂ ܠܕܸܫ̃ܡܸܢ.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܦܝܼܫ ܠܗܘܿܢ ܣܠܝܼܒܹܐ ܙܲܪ̈ܒܵܢܹܐ ܕܠܸܒܵܐ، ܛܡܝܼܪܗܘܿܢ ܒܫܸܢܬܵܝܗ‌ܝ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܘܐܘܼܦ ܚܲܕ ܡ̣ܢ ܩܪ̈ܲܒ݂ܬܵܢܹܐ ܠܵܐ ܡܨܹܐ ܠܗܘܿܢ ܡܲܪܡܝܼ ܐܝܼܕܵܝ̈ܗ‌ܝ.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܡ̣ܢ ܢܓ̰ܵܘܬܘܼܟ݂، ܝܵܐ ܐܲܠܵܗܵܐ ܕܝܲܥܩܘܿܒ݂،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܥܒ݂ܝܼܪܗܘܿܢ ܒܫܸܢܬܵ‌ܐ ܝܲܩܘܼܪܬܵ‌ܐ، ܐܘܼܦ ܪܲܟܵܒ݂ܵܐ ܐܘܼܦ ܣܘܼܣܵܐ.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܐܲܢ݇ܬ، ܣܲܗܡܵܢܵܐ ܝܘܸܬ، ܐܲܢ݇ܬ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܘܡܵܢܝܼ ܡܵܨܹܐ ܟܵܠܹܐ ܩܲܕܡܘܼܟ݂ ܒܥܕܵܢܵܐ ܕܚܸܡܬܘܼܟ݂؟","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܡ̣ܢ ܫܡܲܝܵܐ ܡܘܼܫܡܸܥ ܠܘܼܟ݂ ܕܝܼܘܵܢ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܙܕܝܼܥ ܠܵܗ̇ ܐܲܪܥܵܐ ܘܗܘܹܐ ܠܵܗ̇ ܫܠܝܼܬܵ‌ܐ،","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܟܲܕ ܩܝܼܡ ܠܹܗ ܐܲܠܵܗܵܐ ܠܕܝܼܘܵܢ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܠܦܲܪܘܼܩܹܐ ܟܠܵܝܗ‌ܝ ܡܘܼܠܝܸܨܹܐ ܕܐܲܪܥܵܐ. ܣܹܠܵܗ","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܣܵܒܵܒ ܚܸܡܬܘܼܟ݂ ܠܒܲܪܢܵܫܵܐ ܒܸܬ ܡܲܝܬܝܵܐ ܫܲܟܲܪܬܵ‌ܐ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܘܦܵܝܫܵܢܬܵ‌ܐ ܕܚܸܡܬܵ‌ܐ ܒܸܬ ܡܲܟܠܹܝܬ.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܢܕܘܿܪܘܼܢ ܘܬܲܡܸܡܘܼܢ ܠܗܘܿܢ ܠܡܵܪܝܵܐ ܐܲܠܵܗܵܘܟ݂ܘܿܢ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܟܠܵܝܗ‌ܝ ܕܝܼܢܵܐ ܠܚܵܕܸܪ̈ܘܵܢܘܼܗ‌ܝ ܠܲܒܠܝܼ ܕܲܫܢܹ̈ܐ ܠܣܲܗܡܵܢܵܐ.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܒܸܬ ܩܵܛܹܥ ܪܘܼܚܵܐ ܕܫܲܠܝܼܛܵܢܹ̈ܐ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܣܲܗܡܵܢܵܐ ܝܠܹܗ ܥܲܠ ܡܲܠܟܹ̈ܐ ܕܐܲܪܥܵܐ.","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/aii_abt/PSA/76.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/aii_abt/PSA/77.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/aii_abt/PSA/75.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":12}